How to Download
Go to the Microsoft Download Center.
Click the Download button.
Choose the 64-bit version (PBIDesktopSetup_x64.exe).
Click Next to start downloading the file.

How to Install
Open your Downloads folder and double-click the installer file.
Click Yes if Windows asks to let the app make changes to your device.
Choose your preferred language and click Next.
Check the box to accept the license agreement and click Next.
Keep the default installation folder or pick a new one, then click Next.Click Install.Click Finish once the setup is done

