Section 7 — Business Scenario Questions
91. Sales increased by 15%, but profit declined by 8%. How would you use Power BI to investigate the reason?
92. A CEO says, "Our dashboard has 50 KPIs. Tell me which five I should look at." How would you approach the request rather than simply selecting five metrics?
93. Revenue suddenly dropped in the South region last month. Describe your investigation process in Power BI.
94. A company's inventory has increased by 30%, but customer service levels have not improved. What data and KPIs would you analyze?
95. Two reports show different values for "Total Revenue." One says ₹48 crore and another says ₹52 crore. How would you investigate and resolve the discrepancy?
96. Your Power BI report takes 25 seconds to load. What would you investigate to improve performance?
97. The HR director says employee attrition has increased from 12% to 18%. How would you design an analysis to understand why, while avoiding unsupported causal conclusions?
98. A sales director asks: "Which customers should my team focus on next month?" How would you convert this business question into a Power BI solution?
99. Management wants a single dashboard covering Sales, Finance, Operations, HR, and Supply Chain. How would you design the information hierarchy so that executives see strategic KPIs while functional managers can access deeper operational detail?
100. Final interview case: You receive five million transaction records containing Customer, Product, Region, Salesperson, Order Date, Delivery Date, Quantity, Revenue, Cost, Discount and Returns. The CEO asks, "What is happening in the business, why is it happening, and what should we do?" Walk the interviewer through your complete approach—from business understanding and data preparation through modeling, DAX, visualization, insight generation and management recommendations.

For experienced candidates, I would put the greatest weight on Questions 71–100. The candidate shouldn't merely say, "I would create a dashboard." A stronger answer follows a pattern such as:
Business Question → Required Data → Data Quality → Model → KPI/Measure → Analysis → Insight → Business Impact → Recommended Action

